---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'Terms and Conditions - Teepul Luxury Curtains & Home Decor',
    description: 'Read the Terms and Conditions for purchasing luxury door curtains, window drapes, and home decor from Teepul (Ashank Ecommerce Pvt Ltd), Panipat, Haryana.',
    canonicalUrl: '/terms',
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f4ef] via-[#faf8f4] to-[#f4efe6] text-slate-900 overflow-hidden py-14 lg:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-amber-900/10">
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-amber-900/10 border border-amber-900/20 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>📜 Legal & Governance</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
        Terms and <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Conditions</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Effective Date: September 18, 2026 · Operating Entity: Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited (Panipat, Haryana)
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Legal Content -->
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 space-y-10 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">1.</span> Company Information & Acceptance
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Teepul</strong> (available at <a href="https://teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">https://teepul.com</a>). This digital storefront and brand are owned and operated by <strong>Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited</strong>, a company incorporated under the laws of India, having its primary manufacturing and registered operations located at:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-800">
          <strong>Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited (Teepul)</strong><br />
          Plot No. 142, Sector-25, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Phase-2,<br />
          Panipat, Haryana – 132103, India.<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:support@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline">support@teepul.com</a> · Phone: +91 98765 43210
        </div>
        <p>
          By accessing, browsing, registering an account, or placing an order on our platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions, our Privacy Policy, and our Refund & Shipping Policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">2.</span> Products & Handcrafted Specifications
        </h2>
        <p>
          Teepul specializes in handcrafted premium heavyweight door curtains, French sheer window drapery, ambient lighting, and home decor items manufactured directly at our Panipat mills.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> Standard curtain lengths offered include 5 Feet (Window - 60 inches / 152 cm), 6 Feet (72 inches / 183 cm), 7 Feet (Door - 84 inches / 213 cm), and 9 Feet (Long Door - 108 inches / 274 cm). Width is standard 4 Feet (48 inches / 122 cm).</li>
          <li><strong>Fabric Tolerance:</strong> Due to manual cutting, hemming, and fabric elasticity under tension, a dimensional variance of up to ±1 to 2 inches is an industry-accepted manufacturing characteristic and does not constitute a defect.</li>
          <li><strong>Color Accuracy:</strong> We photograph our collections in studio lighting. Actual fabric shades may slightly vary due to differences in monitor calibration, screen brightness, and mobile display color profiles.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">3.</span> Pricing, Taxes & Payment Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          All product prices displayed on the website are in Indian Rupees (INR ₹) and are inclusive of applicable Goods and Services Tax (GST).
        </p>
        <p>
          We accept secure electronic payments through RBI-licensed payment gateways including <strong>Paytm PG</strong> and <strong>Razorpay</strong> (covering UPI, Debit/Credit Cards, Net Banking, and Mobile Wallets), as well as Cash on Delivery (COD) for eligible pin codes across India.
        </p>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to correct typographical pricing errors. In the rare event an item is listed at an incorrect price, we will contact you prior to dispatch to either confirm the revised price or cancel the order with a full refund.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">4.</span> Orders, Confirmation & Dispatch
        </h2>
        <p>
          Placing an order constitutes an offer to purchase. Upon order receipt, an automated electronic order confirmation will be dispatched to your registered email and mobile number via SMS or WhatsApp.
        </p>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to decline or cancel any order for reasons including non-serviceable pin codes, suspected fraudulent activity, or unverified duplicate COD placements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">5.</span> Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website—including but not limited to brand names, logos, product designs, proprietary photography, descriptive prose, software code, and graphics—is the exclusive intellectual property of <strong>Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Unauthorized copying, reproduction, commercial distribution, scraping, or extraction of our imagery and digital assets without express written consent is strictly prohibited and subject to legal prosecution.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">6.</span> Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by Indian law, Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited and its directors, officers, employees, or affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, punitive, or consequential damages arising out of the use or inability to use our products or services.
        </p>
        <p>
          In all events, our total cumulative liability to you for any claim arising under these terms shall not exceed the actual amount paid by you for the specific product giving rise to the claim.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">7.</span> Governing Law & Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions and any transactions concluded on this website shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the substantive laws of <strong>India</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any dispute, controversy, or claim arising out of or relating to these terms, or the breach, termination, or invalidity thereof, shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts located in <strong>Panipat, Haryana, India</strong>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-700">8.</span> Amendments & Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify or update these terms at any time. Changes will be posted directly to this page with an updated effective date. For legal notices or contractual inquiries, contact:
        </p>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          Legal Department · Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:support@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline">support@teepul.com</a> | <a href="mailto:grievance@teepul.com" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline">grievance@teepul.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
